Description:It is your first main phase. You control Prodigal Pyromancer ({T}: 1 damage to any target) and have Basilisk Collar (equipped creature has deathtouch and lifelink; equip {2}) in hand with three colorless mana floating. The opponent is at 20 life and controls Colossal Dreadmaw (6/6). Destroy the Dreadmaw this turn.
Rule:authored-deathtouch-noncombat-ping | Deathtouch applies to any damage the source deals, not only combat damage (CR 702.2b-c): cast and equip the Collar on the Pyromancer, then its 1-damage ping destroys the 6/6
